{"entryId":"1493","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1493:1","sourceSha256":"b1bcfb14d5dd0d8403113a59b476b7044b4c3b16166dfc244e696bbb4859516c","englishSha256":"58fbe6a65072c26491b20902792397cfeb0454103c57fbe53c5fc37ed450f8d7","citations":[{"id":"1493:1:citation-01","he":[133,166],"en":[211,225],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Moed_Katan_25a.16"},"reference":"Moed Katan 25a:16","assessment":"The funeral passage carries two forms, one in which both stay behind, and one in which Ila went but Chanina did not. Neither gives Chanina a patronymic.","evidence":[{"reference":"Moed Katan 25a:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Moed_Katan_25a.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1493:1:citation-02","he":[219,273],"en":[416,430],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_111a.12"},"reference":"Sanhedrin 111a:12","assessment":"The exact Bavli says ben Gamla, and the retrieved Ein Yaakov has ben Gamliel in the same exposition about Moses.","evidence":[{"reference":"Sanhedrin 111a:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_111a.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ein Yaakov, Sanhedrin 11:139","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ein_Yaakov%2C_Sanhedrin_11.139"},"witness":"Daat"}]},{"id":"1493:1:citation-03","he":[219,273],"en":[468,490],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ein_Yaakov%2C_Sanhedrin_11.139"},"reference":"Ein Yaakov, Sanhedrin 11:139","assessment":"The exact Bavli says ben Gamla, and the retrieved Ein Yaakov has ben Gamliel in the same exposition about Moses.","evidence":[{"reference":"Sanhedrin 111a:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_111a.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ein Yaakov, Sanhedrin 11:139","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ein_Yaakov%2C_Sanhedrin_11.139"},"witness":"Daat"}]},{"id":"1493:1:citation-04","he":[282,320],"en":[518,529],"target":{"url":"